{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": "Patterns run on the message after lower-casing and dropping the Devanagari nukta (so type the pattern without it). Order matters: the first allowed tool that matches wins, so the narrow tools come first. A pattern never uses \\b around Devanagari (a matra is not a word character).",
